&lt;h3&gt;MQTT Logs&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="mqtt-logs"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#mqtt-logs" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;System status is published via the LoggerNode to MQTT topic:&lt;/p&gt;
